# Only what server/Dockerfile needs: the Cargo workspace (shared/, server/, client/ sources) and
# LICENSE. Keeps game files, builds, local data and secrets out of the image.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE
!shared/Cargo.toml
!shared/src
!server/Cargo.toml
!server/src
!server/admin
!server/settings.example.yaml
!client/Cargo.toml
!client/src
!client/assets
